== RedmineUP gem changelog

Redmine UP gem - general functions for plugins (tags, vote, viewing, currency)
Copyright (C) 2011-2026 Kirill Bezrukov (RedmineUP)
https://www.redmineup.com/

== 2026-10-28 v1.1.18

* Added up_acts_as_journalized: change history for any model
* Added open_only option to Issue available_tags
* Updated tags: no commas between chips
* Fixed tags text color and wrapping in tables

== 2026-10-24 v1.1.17

* Fixed gem breaking Redmine 5.0-6.0 on start (Norwegian locale)

== 2026-10-24 v1.1.16

* Added shared styles for tag chips: colored, gray, link
* Added tag_label, tag_label_link(s), tag_sidebar_cloud helpers
* Added tag and tag-merge icons
* Added translations for all languages supported by Redmine
* Fixed websocket reconnection every minute behind nginx
* Fixed error on deleting a person when the viewed model loads later
* Fixed trailing ".0" in amounts of currencies without a fractional unit

== 2026-10-11 v1.1.15

* Speeded up the tags list query (available_tags) on pages with a lot of tagged records

== 2026-10-09 v1.1.14

* Fixed missing calendar icons and extra padding in Redmine 6/7
* Fixed tag field width in forms

== 2026-08-25 v1.1.13

* Updated patches from include to prepend

== 2026-07-23 v1.1.12

* Fixed race condition and added exponential backoff to shared worker websocket reconnect logic
* Added `Redmineup::TestHelper#load_plugin_fixtures` for loading plugin test fixtures

== 2026-06-26 v1.1.11

* Added shared workers for websocket connection

== 2026-06-04 v1.1.10

* Added colorpicker JS component to shared gem assets, loaded globally via `redmineup_assets`
* Fixed viewings table ip column limit to 45 characters for IPv6 address support

== 2026-05-30 v1.1.9

* Added `prices_formatted_collection` to `MoneyHelper` — returns plain text price strings from currency hash, used by query totals

== 2026-05-01 v1.1.8

* Added `on_select` callback and `select_icon` options for `select2tag` helper
* Updated `requires_redmineup` version guard to reduce boilerplate in plugin init
* Fixed `link_to` display compatibility issue in Redmine 5

== 2026-04-18 v1.1.7

* hot fix for atom/rss compatibility for redmine < 5

== 2026-04-17 v1.1.6

* Added helpers for timezone conversions

== 2026-04-17 v1.1.5

* Added tag cloud links helper with URL convention by key
* Added shared tag list fields for views and FormBuilder
* Added shared tag autocomplete route for taggable models
* Updated layout hook to load shared gem assets globally
* Updated tag helpers registration in ActionView context
* Fixed tag color fallback for backward compatibility
* Fixed helper behavior for Ruby 2.3 compatibility

== 2026-04-10 v1.1.4

* Fixed tag queries for MSSQL adapter

== 2026-03-10 v1.1.3

* Added send method for ActionCable
* Fixed ActionCable compatibility with cable.yaml apply

== 2025-11-07 v1.1.2

* Fixed shared assets loading error

== 2025-10-01 v1.1.1

* Updated sprite_icon patch activation logic

== 2025-07-24 v1.1.0

* Added ActionCable methods for plugin integrations
* Added SVG icon support for context menu actions
* Fixed tag migration method for old Rails versions

== 2025-07-09 v1.0.13

* Added tag color support in tag model behavior

== 2025-07-08 v1.0.12

* Added tag color selection functionality

== 2025-03-30 v1.0.11

* Fixed ApplicationRecord loading compatibility

== 2025-02-04 v1.0.10

* Fixed SVG icon compatibility for older Redmine code

== 2025-02-04 v1.0.9

* Added regex_replace Liquid filter
* Added SVG icons for Redmine 6
* Fixed Liquid internal error in filter execution
* Fixed parse_inline_attachments Liquid filter behavior

== 2025-01-31 v1.0.8

* Fixed compatibility patch for Redmine versions below 5

== 2025-01-29 v1.0.7

* Added sprite_icon compatibility patch for Redmine 6
* Fixed parse_inline_attachments Liquid filter behavior

== 2024-05-07 v1.0.6

* Added attachments to IssueDrop and JournalDrop
* Added parse_inline_attachments filter for image URL fix
* Updated Chart.js library to version 3.9.1
* Fixed asset paths for Redmine 5.3 and newer

== 2024-01-31 v1.0.5

* Added plugin_installed? helper for plugin checks
* Fixed ApplicationRecord compatibility patch behavior

== 2023-10-12 v1.0.1

* Added initial public release
* Updated module name from RedmineUp to Redmineup
